pgsodium-libsodium (1.0.22-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Deduplicate private symbols in the C locale, preserving distinct
    underscore aliases under Ubuntu Resolute's locale collation.
  * Reject any unprefixed private references after archive rewriting.
  * Keep private static archive DWARF for the consumer's automatic dbgsym.
  * Package libsodium 1.0.22 as a private, symbol-prefixed PIC static archive
    for pgsodium without replacing the system libsodium ABI.

